WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.134 --> 00:00:15.403
Roxy had to get to downtown Metro City.

2
00:00:15.404 --> 00:00:20.874
She had to stop that giant pink blob!

3
00:00:20.875 --> 00:00:24.185
"I'll be back soon!" Roxy said to her friends.

4
00:00:24.186 --> 00:00:28.367
"I'm, uh, going to go look for Mara!"

5
00:00:28.368 --> 00:00:31.368
Roxy ran off.

6
00:00:31.369 --> 00:00:33.396
Jack scratched his head.

7
00:00:33.397 --> 00:00:36.918
"I thought Roxy didn't know where Mara is."

8
00:00:36.919 --> 00:00:38.626
Terrell frowned.

9
00:00:38.627 --> 00:00:41.055
"I hope she comes back soon.

10
00:00:41.056 --> 00:00:47.728
We can't play kickball with just two people."

11
00:00:47.729 --> 00:00:52.178
A minute later Roxy zoomed into downtown Metro City.

12
00:00:52.179 --> 00:00:55.250
The blob was pink and really, really big.

13
00:00:55.251 --> 00:00:59.149
Roxy watched it move slowly up the side of a skyscraper.

14
00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:02.616
"That looks like bubble gum," thought Roxy.

15
00:01:02.617 --> 00:01:04.460
She sniffed the air.

16
00:01:04.461 --> 00:01:07.117
"It smells like bubble gum too!"

17
00:01:07.118 --> 00:01:09.951
"Rocket Girl!" called a voice.

18
00:01:09.952 --> 00:01:11.938
It was Detective Smith.

19
00:01:11.939 --> 00:01:13.827
Roxy flew to him.

20
00:01:13.828 --> 00:01:16.370
"You know, Detective," she said.

21
00:01:16.371 --> 00:01:19.667
"You're supposed to throw your gum in the trash."

22
00:01:19.668 --> 00:01:23.706
"Ha-ha." Detective Smith pretended to laugh.

23
00:01:23.707 --> 00:01:26.148
"That's not my gum."

24
00:01:26.149 --> 00:01:29.682
"So where did that blob come from?" asked Roxy.

25
00:01:29.683 --> 00:01:32.076
Detective Smith shook his head.

26
00:01:32.077 --> 00:01:37.338
"Nobody knows. It's been here for an hour, and it keeps growing.

27
00:01:37.339 --> 00:01:42.604
If we don't do something soon, it will cover the entire city!"

28
00:01:42.605 --> 00:01:46.375
A bus came around the corner.

29
00:01:46.376 --> 00:01:49.294
"Ahh!" cried the bus driver.

30
00:01:49.295 --> 00:01:51.307
He slammed on the brakes.

31
00:01:51.308 --> 00:01:55.830
Screech! The bus skidded.

32
00:01:55.831 --> 00:01:59.535
The blob reached out. Shlurp!

33
00:01:59.536 --> 00:02:02.218
Pink slime oozed all over the bus.

34
00:02:02.219 --> 00:02:04.425
The blob pulled the bus closer.

35
00:02:04.426 --> 00:02:06.937
Everyone inside began to scream.

36
00:02:06.938 --> 00:02:09.670
"Rocket Girl, save us!"

37
00:02:09.671 --> 00:02:12.097
"Help! Help!"

38
00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:15.119
"This is terrible!" cried a man.

39
00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:17.994
"I'm going to be late for work!"

40
00:02:17.995 --> 00:02:22.612
Roxy shot toward the bus and grabbed its bumper.

41
00:02:22.613 --> 00:02:26.133
She pulled as hard as she could.

42
00:02:26.134 --> 00:02:29.304
"Grr!" Roxy grunted.

43
00:02:29.305 --> 00:02:33.660
Shloop! The bus came free of the blob.

44
00:02:33.661 --> 00:02:36.869
"Thank you, Rocket Girl," said the driver.

45
00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:40.340
The blob groaned. Grarg!

46
00:02:40.341 --> 00:02:43.565
"What's it doing?" Roxy wondered.

47
00:02:43.566 --> 00:02:47.961
Grarg! The blob was growing some more.

48
00:02:47.962 --> 00:02:51.374
It soon filled the street and attached to another building.

49
00:02:51.375 --> 00:02:56.244
"Uh-oh," said Roxy. "The blob is getting bigger!"

50
00:02:56.245 --> 00:02:58.536
Roxy turned to the bus driver.

51
00:02:58.537 --> 00:03:02.994
"Drive away from here! Now!"

52
00:03:02.995 --> 00:03:06.716
The bus sped away as the blob moved to a third building.

53
00:03:06.717 --> 00:03:09.431
Suddenly Roxy heard a muffled sound.

54
00:03:09.432 --> 00:03:13.101
"What's that sound?" Roxy wondered.

55
00:03:13.102 --> 00:03:17.212
She listened with her super hearing.

56
00:03:17.213 --> 00:03:21.135
"Help! Help!"

57
00:03:21.136 --> 00:03:24.208
Roxy shot around to the other side of the blob.

58
00:03:24.209 --> 00:03:27.058
Someone was stuck in it.

59
00:03:27.059 --> 00:03:31.326
Roxy used her super strength to pull the person out.

60
00:03:31.327 --> 00:03:34.218
It was Mara!

61
00:03:34.219 --> 00:03:36.621
"Rocket Girl!" cried Mara.

62
00:03:36.622 --> 00:03:38.866
"I'm glad to see you!

63
00:03:38.867 --> 00:03:45.554
My bubble gum . . . It tried to eat me!"
